<title>TRINIDAD AND TOBAGO: CRICKET-WEST INDIES 296 ALL OUT V INDIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES 296 ALL OUT V INDIA.</headline>
<dateline>PORT OF SPAIN, Trinidad 1997-03-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies</p>
<p>were all out for 296 on the second day of the second test</p>
<p>against India at Queen's Park Oval on Saturday.</p>
</text>
